\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30000833 (OWR-1597-005). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Analysis and Geometric Singularities (2007), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2007/41, pp. 2361--2442; official report source and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2007/41}.
\item[S3] Official EMS Press PDF of the same Oberwolfach report; PDF pages 21--23, printed pages 2381--2383.
\url{https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/46126}.
\item[S4] Schwarzschild nonlinear stability; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
\url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08222}.
\item[S5] linear Schwarzschild stability; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
\url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1601.06467}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30000833}

